<title>USA: ATRION CFO retiring, VP assuming duties.</title>
<headline>ATRION CFO retiring, VP assuming duties.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Ala. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATRION Corp said Thursday that George Petty will retire as chief financial officer February 1.</p>
<p>The company said Jeffery Strickland, its vice president pf corporate development and assistant secretary-treasurer, will assume Petty's position and responsibilities.</p>
</text>
